1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:06,190
Man: Listen to a talk on a biology podcast.

2
00:00:06,190 --> 00:00:11,230
Picture a creature that's smaller than a mouse, yet as territorial as a lion.

3
00:00:11,230 --> 00:00:13,290
Does it sound like a cartoon character?

4
00:00:13,290 --> 00:00:18,010
It's actually the real-life Scarlet Badis, a freshwater fish.

5
00:00:18,010 --> 00:00:20,110
It's only about 2 cm long at most.

6
00:00:20,110 --> 00:00:24,290
In the wild, it generally thrives peacefully in the slow-moving streams of India.

7
00:00:24,290 --> 00:00:27,120
Because of its size and attractive coloring

8
00:00:27,180 --> 00:00:30,210
it's also a popular choice for aquariums and fish tanks.

9
00:00:30,210 --> 00:00:36,150
However, in captive environments like aquariums, males are more aggressive.

10
00:00:36,150 --> 00:00:40,440
They'll chase and nip at other males if they encroach on their territory,

11
00:00:40,440 --> 00:00:43,080
so it's crucial to include lots of vegetation.

12
00:00:43,080 --> 00:00:47,290
Plants act as hiding places and borderlines between males' territories.

13
00:00:47,290 --> 00:00:54,120
Now male Scarlet Badis are a vivid orangish-red, scarlet with light bluish stripes.

14
00:00:54,120 --> 00:00:58,906
When a male isn't having a confrontation with another male in the aquarium though,

15
00:00:58,906 --> 00:00:59,980
his scarlet is less bright

16
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:05,059
it can almost, but not quite, resemble female coloring, which is dull gray.

17
00:01:05,059 --> 00:01:07,835
This could make it hard to tell the sexes apart,

18
00:01:07,835 --> 00:01:12,000
except if you can see any scarlet at all on the fish, it's a male.

19
00:01:12,000 --> 00:01:17,020
Plus, unlike in most fish species, males are also usually a bit larger than females.

20
00:01:17,020 --> 00:01:22,050
And the other time a male Scarlet Badis shows his brightest coloring is during breeding season.

21
00:01:22,050 --> 00:01:26,240
In aquariums, he can be observed doing a sort of dance to impress females.

22
00:01:26,240 --> 00:01:31,780
Showing himself off, his dance also involves following the female around until she decides

23
00:01:31,780 --> 00:01:35,000
whether to mate with him.
